# Agent guide — {{ project_name }}

Read **[CONVENTIONS.md](./CONVENTIONS.md)** first (folder tree, import matrix, golden code).

## Structure

- Product code: `apps/web/src/modules/<module>/{module.ts,public.ts,shared,features/<feature>}`
- Feature layout: `features/<feature>/{index.ts,api,hooks,model,views/{pages,components},routes,locales}`
- Protected (lead-owned): `packages/ui-kit`, `apps/web/src/app`, `apps/web/src/core`
- Reference example: `modules/catalog` (items + categories)

## Do

- Scaffold with `pnpm new-module <name>` / `pnpm new-feature <module>/<name>`
- Declare features with `defineFeature`, modules with `defineModule` (auto-registered)
- Query keys via a tenant-scoped keys factory; data access only in `hooks/` through `useApi`
- Build pages with `ListPage` / `DetailPage` / `FormPage` + `QueryState`
- Import UI only from `@aham/ui-kit` / `@aham/ui-kit/components`
- Use `t()` for user-facing copy (en + ja); register nav with `labelKey`
- Declare `permission` on every non-core route
- Cross-module reuse only through the other module's `public.ts`
- Colocate tests (`*.test.ts[x]`); use `TestProviders` from `@aham/ui-kit/testing`
- Change theme / locale / regional formats only via kit Preferences APIs / `/settings`
- Local data without a backend: `VITE_USE_MOCKS=1 pnpm dev` (MSW handlers in `*.handlers.ts`)

## Do not

- Edit `packages/ui-kit`, `app/`, `core/` unless `DX_ALLOW_BASELINE=1`
- Import `lucide-react`, `axios`, `@radix-ui/*`, or `@aham/ui-kit/primitives` in the app
- Call `fetch`/api client from views, or put JSX in `api/` / `hooks/`
- Deep-import another feature or module internals
- Hardcode colors/font sizes (`text-[13px]`, `bg-[#…]`); use kit components + layout utilities
- Invent themes outside kit-registered presets

Run `pnpm dx check` after edits. Commit/CI runs the **full** rule set on the whole repo.
